Package: signfield
# Vendored wheels include CPython 3.13 extension modules (pydantic-core,
# lxml, aiohttp), so the package is tied to this arch and Python minor.
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libc6, python3 (>= 3.13~), python3 (<< 3.14~),
 python3-pyqt6, python3-pyqt6.qtwebengine
Description: Validator for digitally signed Indian government PDFs
 SignField checks PDF signatures made under the CCA India PKI (e-Aadhaar,
 e-PAN, DigiLocker, GST, DSC-signed documents): integrity, coverage, the
 certificate chain to a CCA India root, validity at signing time and
 revocation. For a valid file it builds a flattened display copy in which
 the "validity unknown" mark becomes a green tick.
 .
 pyHanko and its dependencies are vendored: Debian 13 ships cryptography 43,
 and pyHanko 0.37 needs 48 or newer.
